      "text": "Combine the plan query + original claim.\nClean / deduplicate keyword variants.\nFuse per-filing ranks: Σ 1 / (60 + rank).\nDefault: read one passage per filing.\nAdditional searches can request up to three\nper filing to fill a specific evidence gap.",
