      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793901027881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "passage_id, filing_id, form, period_end, filed_at, source_url, pdf_sha256\npdf_page, page_start, page_end, text, is_toc, page_context\nThe canonical text authenticates citations; compact model views remove repeated headers\nand whitespace. Page text can be reassembled from stored overlapping chunks for checks.",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "passage_id, filing_id, form, period_end, filed_at, source_url, pdf_sha256\npdf_page, page_start, page_end, text, is_toc, page_context\nThe canonical text authenticates citations; compact model views remove repeated headers\nand whitespace. Page text can be reassembled from stored overlapping chunks for checks.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
