      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793901027881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Return the concrete error to the Executor, not a silent relabel.\nNumeric feedback includes the resolved source value and column.\nThe model can read more evidence or submit a corrected candidate.\nRetry only while budget remains; missing disclosure is not falsehood.\nExact quotation proves provenance, not every semantic conclusion.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Return the concrete error to the Executor, not a silent relabel.\nNumeric feedback includes the resolved source value and column.\nThe model can read more evidence or submit a corrected candidate.\nRetry only while budget remains; missing disclosure is not falsehood.\nExact quotation proves provenance, not every semantic conclusion.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
