      "text": "Available filings do not resolve it.\nExample: an undisclosed regional\nheadcount or future revenue forecast.\nKeep context / search trail; do not\ninvent.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Available filings do not resolve it.\nExample: an undisclosed regional\nheadcount or future revenue forecast.\nKeep context / search trail; do not\ninvent.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
