      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793901027881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "queued → started → step* → result → done(outcome=result)\nOn service error: error → done(outcome=error); cancellation propagates.\nClient checks content type, event shape, matching run IDs, final result and done.\nA truncated / mixed / failed stream is shown as an error, not a successful report.\nModel/tool events include observable actions and measured usage, not private reasoning.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "queued → started → step* → result → done(outcome=result)\nOn service error: error → done(outcome=error); cancellation propagates.\nClient checks content type, event shape, matching run IDs, final result and done.\nA truncated / mixed / failed stream is shown as an error, not a successful report.\nModel/tool events include observable actions and measured usage, not private reasoning.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
