      "text": "Statement: 1–4,000 characters; namespace: 1–80 characters.\nDefault budgets: 8 model / 16 tool calls; allowed maxima: 20 / 40.\nInvalid API input → HTTP 422. Batch: 1–100 statements.\nBatch import extracts statement text; gold labels never go to the API.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Statement: 1–4,000 characters; namespace: 1–80 characters.\nDefault budgets: 8 model / 16 tool calls; allowed maxima: 20 / 40.\nInvalid API input → HTTP 422. Batch: 1–100 statements.\nBatch import extracts statement text; gold labels never go to the API.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
