      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1446869730,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793901027881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "search_and_read(query, filing_id?, per_filing=1,\nadditional_queries? up to 2)\n→ ranked complete passages + read IDs + searched filing IDs\nread_passage(passage_id)\n→ one complete canonical passage; its ID now counts as read\nread_page_context(filing_id, pdf_page)\n→ first chunks of the page and its neighbours + navigation IDs\nsubmit_verdict(evidence[], explanation, verdict)\n→ special validated final submission; no other call beside it\nlist_filings / search_filings remain internal; catalogue is supplied.\nAdd ordinary tools in tools.py; the generic Executor dispatch stays the same.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "search_and_read(query, filing_id?, per_filing=1,\nadditional_queries? up to 2)\n→ ranked complete passages + read IDs + searched filing IDs\nread_passage(passage_id)\n→ one complete canonical passage; its ID now counts as read\nread_page_context(filing_id, pdf_page)\n→ first chunks of the page and its neighbours + navigation IDs\nsubmit_verdict(evidence[], explanation, verdict)\n→ special validated final submission; no other call beside it\nlist_filings / search_filings remain internal; catalogue is supplied.\nAdd ordinary tools in tools.py; the generic Executor dispatch stays the same.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
